{"id":"n82210-2-8","stage":4,"title":"축복 · 祝福","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82210-2-8-1","ko":"너 피아노를 정말 잘 치는구나! 신이 축복을 내린 손 같았어!","zh":"你钢琴弹得真好！那双手简直像得到上天祝福一样！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"피아노를","meaning":"钢琴","explanation":"피아노：钢琴；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"피아노","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31505","senseId":"1","lemma":"피아노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피아노를","audio":"/audio/4f75ffb8b43e9d15d618.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"치는구나!","meaning":"弹，弹奏，打","explanation":"치다：弹，弹奏，打；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"3","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치는구나","audio":"/audio/b333b5900a49703c0ed1.mp3"}},{"text":"신이","meaning":"上帝，神","explanation":"신：上帝，神；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신","audio":"/audio/e609f3d29b9f741ae96e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13993","senseId":"1","lemma":"신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],